Package: GenomicSEM
Type: Package
Title: Structural equation modeling based on GWAS summary statistics
Version: 0.0.5
Author: Andrew Grotzinger, Matthijs van der Zee, Mijke Rhemtulla, Hill Ip, Michel Nivard, Elliot Tucker-Drob
Maintainer: Andrew Grotzinger <agrotzin@utexas.edu>
Description: Fits structural equation models to GWAS summary statistics and provides utilities for LD score regression preprocessing, multivariate GWAS, transcriptome-wide analyses, and optional Rust-backed acceleration for supported workflows.
